WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.704
Day 5. Halfway Check.

2
00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:07.379
Today is the halfway check. Your child does the seven things on the page. Do not help.

3
00:00:07.829 --> 00:00:09.874
Mark each one in the box at the bottom.

4
00:00:10.374 --> 00:00:12.732
Six or seven right? Go on to day six.

5
00:00:13.132 --> 00:00:19.848
Fewer? Do days two, three and four again, with real things first, then come back. That is not falling behind.

6
00:00:20.648 --> 00:00:27.090
The next page is a game. Your child fills in the missing numbers on the path, then hops along it with a finger.
